        "created_at": "2014-04-23T01:10:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Put Shock Rounds on top of deck</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Expatriette</strong></p><p><strong>HP</strong>: 16</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp;Unload, &nbsp;RPG Launcher, Hollow Points</p><p><strong>In play</strong>: , Speed Loading, Hairtrigger Reflexes, Assault Rifle, \"Pride\"</p><p><strong>Trash</strong>:&nbsp;Liquid Nitrogen Rounds, Arsenal Access, RPG Launcher,&nbsp;Tactical Shotgun, Quick Draw, Submachine Gun, Reload,&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Additional effects</strong>: Whenever a non-hero target enters play, Expat deals that target 1 projectile damage</p><p><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Start of hero turn:&nbsp;</strong>Put Hollow Points next to Assault Rifle</p><p><strong>Play a card</strong>:&nbsp;RPG Launcher. &nbsp;Destroy Speed Loading. &nbsp;Deal net 5 fire damage to Operative (22) and net 4 to Chairman (22)</p><p><strong>Use a power</strong>:&nbsp;Assault Rifle Chairman for net 6 (16) and Operative for net 7 (15)</p><p><strong>Draw a card</strong>:&nbsp;Shock Rounds</p><p><strong>End of hero turn</strong>:</p><p><strong>​----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>HP</strong>: 17</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp;Unload, Shock Rounds</p><p><strong>In play</strong>: &nbsp;Hairtrigger Reflexes, Assault Rifle, \"Pride\"</p><p><strong>Trash</strong>:&nbsp;Liquid Nitrogen Rounds, Arsenal Access, RPG Launcherx2,&nbsp;Tactical Shotgun, Quick Draw, Submachine Gun, Reload, Hollow Points</p><p><strong>Additional effects</strong>: Whenever a non-hero target enters play, Expat deals that target 1 projectile damage</p>",
