      {
        "id": 99465,
        "name": "grysqrl",
        "username": "grysqrl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-23T02:40:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok. I'll play Recompile on Argent's turn. Discard Updated Intel, Quick Calculation, Targeting Arrow. Draw Syntactic Analysis, Gauge, Exploit Vulnerability, Data-Mining, Reveal the Flaws, Gauge. Tachyon's next damage is +3.</p><p><strong>Parse</strong></p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 13<br><strong>Hand:</strong> Data-Mining, Syntactic Analysis, Targeting Arrow, Exploit Vulnerability, Gauge (2), Reveal the Flaws<br><strong>Play:</strong> Critical Multiplier, Extrasensory Awareness, Snap Decision<br><strong>Trash:</strong> Data-Mining, Quick Calculation, Recompile, Targeting Arrow (2), Buffer Overflow, Exploit Vulnerability, Reveal the Flaws, Segmentation Fault, Updated Intel<br><strong>Effects:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Whenever Parse discards a card from hand, select a hero target. Increase the next damage dealt by that target by 1. (Tachyon +3)</li>\n<li>Damage dealt to the Operative is +1</li>\n</ul><p>----------------------------</p><p><strong>Start:</strong> Discard Gauge (+1 to Tachyon's next damage - now +4) and play Syntactic Analysis on Tachyon (reveal top two cards and play/draw/discard them in any order)<br><strong>Play:</strong> Reveal the Flaws - Damage dealt by heroes is irreducible<br><strong>Power:</strong> Extrasensory Awareness - reveal the top 3 of the villain deck; discard ?; replace ? (top) and ? (second) on top of the deck; maybe shuffle<br><strong>Draw:</strong><strong> </strong>Impossible Shot<br><strong>End:</strong></p><p>----------------------------</p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 13<br><strong>Hand:</strong> Data-Mining, Targeting Arrow, Exploit Vulnerability, Gauge, Impossible Shot<br><strong>Play:</strong> Critical Multiplier, Extrasensory Awareness, Snap Decision, Reveal the Flaws<br><strong>Trash:</strong> Data-Mining, Quick Calculation, Recompile, Targeting Arrow (2), Buffer Overflow, Exploit Vulnerability, Reveal the Flaws, Segmentation Fault, Updated Intel, Gauge, Syntactic Analysis<br><strong>Effects:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Whenever Parse discards a card from hand, select a hero target. Increase the next damage dealt by that target by 1.</li>\n<li>Damage dealt by hero targets is irreducible</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Pending Syntactic Analysis from Tachyon and Extrasensory Awareness reveals.</strong></p><p><strong>Question: Does Tachyon benefit from the +1 to Operative boost? It goes away at the start of my turn, but Snap Decision (which allows Tachyon to play some cards) was played before Targeting Arrow (whose effect ends at the start of my turn...after Snap Decision happens?)</strong></p>",
