        "created_at": "2014-04-23T03:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Syntactic Analysis reveals Hypersonic Assault and Lightspeed Barrage. Put both in my hand.</p><p>I believe playing Hypersonic Assault now will make it expire at the start of my turn, and I want at least a couple more Bursts for Lightspeed Barrage.&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT : It occurred to me that the Critical Multiplier would actually buff my self damage from Pushing the Limits, so I'll put the Lightspeed Barrage into play and hit the Operative for 9 base + 4 CM + 1 TA + 2 OF - 1 DR = 15. That should take care of her.&nbsp;</p>",
