        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-23T03:18:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know Parse &amp; Tachyon still have some stuff to deal with, but I'm headed to bed soon. Lacking other information, I think I'm getting one of the SO damage boosts since I'll have lots of instances, but that didn't appear to be decided.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Technological Advancement back on top from Vernal Sonata.</p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 17</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong> Reset, Singularity, Self-Sabotage, Disruptive Flechettes, Rocket Punch, Bio-Engineering Beam</p><p><strong>In Play:</strong> Gaussian Coil Blaster, Reactive Plating Subroutine, Rocket Punch, Elemental Exochassis, Defensive Blast, Electro-Deployment Unit</p><p><strong>Trash: </strong>Reset, Disruptive Flechettes, Innervation Ray, Self-Sabotage, Disruptive Flechettes, Technological Advancement,</p><p>----</p><p>Start: Gaussian Coil Blaster deals 4 (1 + SO + 2xOF) damage to each of the Chairman and the Operative.</p><p>EDU draws Technological Advancement.</p><p>Play: Technological Advancement. Go fishing for the other EDU, shuffle, and draw Slip Through Time</p><p>Power: Rocket Punch to deal 5 damage to the Chairman and 4 damage to the Operative.</p><p>Draw: Bio-Engineering Beam</p><p>End: Nothing</p><p>-----</p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 17</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong> Reset, Singularity, Self-Sabotage, Disruptive Flechettes, Rocket Punch, Bio-Engineering Beam, Bio-Engineering Beam</p><p><strong>In Play:</strong> Gaussian Coil Blaster, Reactive Plating Subroutine, Rocket Punch, Elemental Exochassis, Defensive Blast, Electro-Deployment Unit x2</p><p><strong>Trash: </strong>Reset, Disruptive Flechettes, Innervation Ray, Self-Sabotage, Disruptive Flechettes, Technological Advancement,</p>",
