        "created_at": "2014-04-23T03:54:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Extrasensory Awareness reveals:</p><p>Rook City Is Mine! (x2) and Perfect Human Specimans</p><p>Operative (X) and Chairman at (7) after Omni-X turn.</p><p>Tachyon still to go this round as things wind down.</p>",
