      {
        "id": 99469,
        "name": "Kharnel",
        "username": "Kharnel",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kharnel/{size}/1984_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-23T04:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>T​achyon</strong></p><p><strong>HP:</strong>&nbsp;12<br><strong>Hand:</strong><span>&nbsp;Blinding Speed, Accelerated Assault, Sucker Punch, Fleet of Foot, Hypersonic Assault</span><br><strong>Play:</strong><span>&nbsp;HUD Goggles, Research Grant, Pushing the Limits</span><br><strong>Trash:&nbsp;</strong><span>Fleet of Foot x 2, Synaptic Interruption x 2, Pushing the Limits x 2, Quick Insight, Blinding Speed, Lightning Reflexes, Sucker Punch, Hypersonic Assault x 3, Supersonic Response, Nimble Strike, Sonic Vortex,&nbsp;</span><span>Lightspeed Barrage</span><br><strong>Effects:</strong><span>&nbsp;The Chairman and the Operative may not deal damage until the start of Tachyon's turn</span></p><p>----------------------------</p><p><strong>Start:</strong>&nbsp; Hypersonic Assault's effect wears off. Tachyon deals 4 damage to herself.<br><strong>Play:</strong>&nbsp;Fleet of Foot -&nbsp;<strong>Everybody draw</strong>. Draw Lightning Reflexes<br><strong>Play:&nbsp;</strong>Hypersonic Assault - deals 3 damage to Chairman (4)<br><strong>Play:&nbsp;</strong>Accelerated Assault - deals 3 damage to Chairman (1)<br><strong>Play:&nbsp;</strong>Sucker Punch Chairman (X)<br><strong>Power:</strong>&nbsp;Use Research Grant.<br><strong>Draw:&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>End:</strong></p><p>----------------------------</p><p>I think that might have been the smoothest Chairman game I've had.</p>",
